      "new": "        (externalDisplayWindow as? com.moblin.android.platform.uikit.ExternalDisplayWindow)?.isHidden = database.externalDisplayContent == SettingsExternalDisplayContent.mirror",
      "note": "Swift makeKeyAndVisible() for stream, clean stream and chat, and resignKey() plus isHidden = true for mirror, so that the system mirrors the phone screen again."
